# ---------------------------------------------------------------- ROM data
# Never, under any circumstances. The whole design of these mods is that they
# ship code which DERIVES from your own cartridge dump and never carries the
# dump itself -- committing one would undo that in a single push.
*.gb
*.gbc
*.sgb
*.sav
*.srm
*.state

# ------------------------------------------------------------ other people's
# The engine build, the voxel mod, and any downloaded sprite packs. Not ours
# to redistribute, and large.
*.apk
*.ipa
BATTLE_ART_VOXEL_FORK*/
sprites/
*.zip

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- derived
# Rebuildable from the APK by splitscreen/build.ps1 or linux/build.sh, so
# there is no reason to carry 3 MB of it in history. Both builders default to
# a `game/` directory beside themselves.
*.love
game/

# The LOVE runtime, unpacked by setup-love.ps1 from the official build.
splitscreen/love/

# --------------------------------------------------------------- generated art
# Follower frames are built from your ROM on first boot and live in the save
# directory, but ignore the mod-local folder too in case anything lands there.
GHOST_LINK/assets/followers/*.png
GHOST_LINK/assets/followers/*.gif

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------- junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
*.tmp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
